# The one app is deployed from here (its Vercel project's Root Directory is
# bishnoi-one-app/frontend), so this keeps everything else out: the APIs, their
# settings and local databases, documents and tools. The CLI doesn't read
# .gitignore (decided 2026-10-27). Listed one by one: Vercel's matching can't
# add a folder back after "ignore everything", which uploaded nothing.

# Every other app
/bishnoi-admin
/bishnoi-crm
/bishnoi-finance
/bishnoi-in-licensing
/bishnoi-inventory
/bishnoi-pharmacy
/bishnoi-platform
/bishnoi-regulatory

# Everything else at the top
/.claude
/.github
/benchmarks
/brand
/desktop
/docs
/scripts
/*.docx
/*.md
/package.json

# Anywhere: secrets, local data, what Vercel installs and builds itself
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.data
**/*.db
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.next
